    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald O'Leary Kinsella are delighted to present this attractive four-bedroom dormer-style residence, ideally situated in the sought-after rural location not far outside Enniscorthy. Extending to approximately 142 sq. m., this well-presented home offers spacious and versatile accommodation over two floors and is presented in very good condition throughout.\n\nThe property combines the peace and tranquillity of a countryside setting with excellent accessibility to Enniscorthy and the wider road network. The M11 motorway exit towards Dublin is less than seven minutes away, while Enniscorthy town is approximately 7 km from the property, making this an ideal location for those commuting while still wishing to enjoy a rural lifestyle.\n\nOn entering the property, the accommodation is bright and welcoming, with the ground floor comprising a spacious kitchen/dining area, separate living room, sun room, two bedrooms, bathroom and useful utility/laundry area. The kitchen is well fitted with ample storage and workspace, while the adjoining dining area provides an excellent space for family living and entertaining. The sun room is a particularly attractive feature, enjoying extensive glazing and lovely views over the surrounding gardens.\n\nThe first floor provides two further bedrooms and a bathroom, offering excellent flexibility for family accommodation, guest bedrooms or home working. The house is finished to a good standard throughout and benefits from a B-rated BER, providing good energy efficiency.\n\nExternally, the property sits on a generous and beautifully maintained site with extensive gravelled parking to the front and side, mature hedging providing privacy, and substantial lawns and gardens surrounding the house. The grounds offer excellent space for family enjoyment and outdoor activities. There are also a detached garage/workshop to the rear giving useful extra storage space. \n\nOne of the standout features of this property is the superb countryside setting, with wonderful views across the surrounding farmland and towards the distant hills. The property offers a rare combination of generous accommodation, extensive grounds, excellent privacy and convenient access to Enniscorthy and the M11 motorway.\n\nThis is a well-maintained family home in a highly convenient rural location and viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the accommodation, grounds and setting on offer."
      },
